sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent/LLM Adapter
    participant H as PassiveMemoryHook
    participant G as Governance
    participant C as ContextEngine
    participant M as SQLite Canonical Memory
    participant Q as Async Write Queue
    participant O as Outbox/LanceDB
    participant T as Trace/Metrics

    A->>H: before_invoke(event)
    H->>G: project + trust + context gate
    G-->>H: allow / skip / degraded
    alt allowed
        H->>C: context_supply(compact, request_scope)
        C->>C: vector + BM25 + FTS + graph + RRF
        C-->>H: compact context + memory ids
        H->>T: preload span + hit metadata
        H-->>A: bounded context slot injection
    else denied or degraded
        H->>T: degradation event
        H-->>A: minimum safe context
    end

    A->>A: LLM + tools + workflow execution
    A->>H: after_invoke(event, outcome)
    H->>Q: enqueue candidate extraction
    H-->>A: immediate acknowledgement

    Q->>G: classify source + proposal policy
    Q->>M: smart-remember / memory_store transaction
    M->>M: dedupe + tags + entity links + conflict candidates
    M->>T: call span + lineage + relation metrics
    M->>O: store_outbox(action, version, embedding hash)
    O->>O: vector + BM25/FTS derived index update
    O->>T: outbox lag + index outcome

    A->>H: step-closure(lesson, improvement, root_cause, optimization)
    H->>M: high-confidence reflection memory
    H->>T: closure + adoption feedback
